{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth is threatened by an alien force and bombarded with asteroids. You are the last hope to save the earth. Will you accept the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend Earth against alien asteroid attacks in this arcade shooter and experience the evolution of the genre in a gripping visual and auditory adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Defend, Fail, Upgrade, Repeat and Strike Back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game is a classic arcade space shooter with roguelike elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your ship is destroyed, you can permanently upgrade it, provided you have collected enough alien tech. With each upgrade, the visuals evolve too \u2013 from 2-bit black and white, through retro styles, all the way to modern graphics \u2013 letting you relive the history of shooter visuals.<br><br>Includes modding support \u2013 replace graphics and share your creations.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You got 'em all!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002010/bd1f9cb0ce3650aa2410fe3b1e844a37d106efd7.jpg"},{"name":"Planetary security restored!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002010/c6fd793d0828dc7aa9822ec6022f9406ccab0fc9.jpg"},{"name":"Full Upgrade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002010/3a92b2845e933666e9c9fc953ad74f444ff2b89e.jpg"},{"name":"Galactic Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002010/7155ea3fad4d256deebaf7f54fd42c1dd44377f5.jpg"},{"name":"Cosmic Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002010/2d5415867adc82799f580e61f01542853e4c7cf9.jpg"},{"name":"Asteroid Annihilator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4002010/f976abb45269b859ea320e07d58437446cac4d22.jpg"},{"name":"Rock B